            ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
              Emit('>');
              NextToken;
              GenExpr;
            ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ curToken = 62 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
